# Snapshot expectations are compared byte for byte, and are generated with
# newlines. Checking them out with CRLF on Windows makes every one of them
# differ from what the run produces, invisibly — the difference is in bytes
# the comparison of lines cannot see.
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.graphql text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
